  "reference": "Abaramuzi 15",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "15",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akanya kakahingwireho omu bukiro bw'eigesha ly'engano, Samusoni agya kuleba mukaziwe; amutwalira n'omwana gw'embuzi. Agamba ati, “Kangye ndare na mukazi wange.” Kyonkai ishe mwisiki amutanga kurara nawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishe mwisiki agamba ati, “Mbaire natekeleize nti omutamiirwe kimoi, kityo namusiigira mutahi wawe. Mutowe ni murungi kumushaga. Ba niwe otwara.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samusoni abagambira ati, “Lero mbwenu Abafilisiti tibankwate mushango kandabakora kubi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho agenda akwata emiha 300, akwata n'enkanzi; agyolekejanyia emikira, buli mikira ebili akomaho enkanzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kayabaire yataireho enkanzi omuliro, ataishura emiha etaha omu misiri y'engano y'Abafilisiti, ayokya emiganda n'engano etakagesirwe, n'endimiro z'emizeituni kwakwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Abafilisiti bagamba bati, “Eki kyakorw'ohai?” Bagamba bati, “Samusoni omukoi w'Omutimuni, orw'okutwara mukaziwe akamusiigira mutahiwe.” Abafilisiti baizira kimoi bokya omukazi na ishe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samusoni abagambira ati, “Kamuraba nimugira muti, ninahira kubehoroza, mara nshube ngende.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abatera kibero na itako, abaita eitura mpungu; asongoka agya aikara omu mpako y'orwazi rwa Etamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Abafilisiti bagya Yuda basisira bashuba banyaga ekigo kya Lehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu ba Yuda bagamba bati, “Kiki inywe kutuzinda?” Bagamba bati, “Twaija kuboha Samusoni, tumukore nk'okwo atukozire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho abantu ba Yuda 3,000 basongoka omu mpako y'orwazi rwa Etamu bagambira Samusoni bati, “Tolikumanya okwo Abafilisiti balikukutwara? Mbwenu kiki eki eky'otukozire?” Abagambira ati, “Okwo bankozire nanye nikwo mbakozire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamugambira bati, “Twaija kukuboha, tukunage omu mikono y'Abafilisiti.” Samusoni abagambira ati, “Munnahilire okwo mutanyite.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamugambira bati, “Chei, turakuboha kushai tukunage omu mikono yabo, titukwite.” Aho bamubohesa emiguha emihya ebili, bamwihya omu rwazi bamutembya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kayagobire Lehi, Abafilisiti baija nibashana kumubuganganwa. Aho Mwoyo wa Mukama amutungamira n'amani, n'emiguha eyabaire emuli aha mikono eshusha orukoba rukwetwe omuliro, n'empingoze zagilira zimuruga aha mikono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwamu orushaya rw'endogobe orukyaina amagara, aimukya omukono arukwata, arwisa abantu 1,000. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samusoni agamba ati,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aija akwatwa eiliho lingi muno atakira Omukama ati, “Otutungire obujuni obu bw'amani, watwihuza omukono gw'omwiru wawe; mbwenu nyitwe eiliho, nshube ngwe omu mikono y'abatatahiriirwe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Ruhanga atabura enchuro omu kiina ekili Lehi kirugwamu amaizi. Orwo yanyoire amaizi omwoyo gumugarukamu, agira amani. Aha rw'ekyo enchuro egyo bakagyeta Enakore; eli Lehi kugoba kir'eki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samusoni akaramura Isiraeli omu biro bw'Abafilisiti emyaka 20.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.15.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
